.th NEXT I 5/31/77
.sh NAME
next \*- new standard input for shell procedure
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd next
[ filename ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
This command causes
.it filename
to become standard input.
The current input is never resumed.
If no filename is given, the real terminal is assumed.
.s3
.it Next
is executed within the shell.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
sh(I)
